<title>USA: UARCO picked to supply Premier Inc.</title>
<headline>UARCO picked to supply Premier Inc.</headline>
<dateline>BARRINGTON, Ill. 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>UARCO Inc said Monday it was contracted by Premier Inc, a large healthcare purchasing group, to supply it with comprehensive forms and forms management services.</p>
<p>UARCO said it expects its share of the agreement will be at least $500 million over five years. Premier represents more than 1,800 acute-care hospitals and 8,000 alternate sites.</p>
<p>UARCO said the contract covers production, distribution, administration and management of paper and electronic documents.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
